---
import ArticleLayout from '../../layouts/ArticleLayout.astro'
const meta = {
  title: 'Nuestra Historia — Resumen',
  date: '2024-02-10',
  category: 'Historia',
  image: 'https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBBSe1pG-Ma9io-6WYbk-W9vanp_4IvufzxuwLSJ-jf0CUsDot5CcUNguLay1U64CeZdHMY3a367Fm2otDBqXsLKRZhpbXnOvHWhdapv7NUsE5MLMlcpht4n46J7yM7YmkJtrcFFeJRWRtS6dt6ke5AXQBh4s4aqAJY_WyXP8wB4ZfoPEYnz2ZQcy4VB30t3ecEWfqDpcLmuhf2Ic8LrwnfMuzqc8pTybhxPYVJOAWQHIYid8__jTDQ-7oNVs4LE5m8rWZsVv6TK0E'
}
---

<ArticleLayout title={meta.title} description="Breve reseña histórica">
  <article class="layout-content-container flex flex-col max-w-[960px] w-full flex-1 px-4 lg:px-20 py-10 lg:py-16">
    <div class="flex gap-3 mb-6">
      <div class="flex h-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-x-2 rounded-full bg-primary/20 pl-3 pr-3">
        <p class="text-black text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide leading-normal">{meta.category}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 mb-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em]">{meta.title}</h1>
      <p class="text-[#898361] text-xl lg:text-2xl font-normal leading-relaxed italic">Una mirada condensada a nuestros hitos más importantes.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-lg prose-neutral dark:prose-invert max-w-none font-display">
      <p>
        En pocas líneas destacamos los momentos que marcaron el rumbo de la orquesta: fundación, primeras giras, hitos de repertorio y eventos comunitarios.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</ArticleLayout>
